The Stop prompt dispatches the note-processing skill to extend existing spans or create missing coverage, validate anchors and whys against the current tree, and remove only successfully processed notes. The skill and integration guide preserve that scope and its unstaged delivery; requirement conflicts remain explicit rather than being hidden by refreshed anchors. The prompt passes no session scope, so the skill locates notes across repositories used in the session.
